---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy | ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description={`How ${SITE_NAME} handles your images and data.`}
>
  <article class="prose-block max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <p>
        Your images are processed inside your browser. They are not uploaded to our servers or to
        anyone else's, and we cannot see them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Like any website, the hosting provider may keep basic technical logs, such as the pages
        requested and the time of the request. These logs do not contain your images.
      </p>
      <p>
        If analytics or advertising are added to this site, they may set cookies or collect usage
        information such as pages viewed. Update this page to describe whichever services you
        switch on, and add a cookie notice where the law in your visitors' countries requires one.
      </p>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the site owner at the address shown on the site.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
